    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d131">

                <pb facs="0130" n="120" sameAs="frus:frus1944v04/pg120"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.53/43: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in the United
                        Kingdom</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Winant</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-05-30T16:00:00-04:00">May 30, 1944—4
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>4290. Lisbon’s 245 to London, May 25.<anchor n="94" xml:id="d131-f1"/> As Salazar
                    apparently has given no definite answer and as meanwhile wolfram exports
                    presumably continue, the Department considers that concerted action might well
                    be taken immediately toward obtaining from Salazar a temporary embargo to be
                    maintained at least while the wolfram conversations continue. The Spanish
                    Government found no difficulty in taking this step last January and in making
                    its temporary embargo applicable to all wolfram stocks including production of
                    German mines and accumulated German stocks ready for shipment.</p>
                <p>Sent to London, repeated to Lisbon and Rio de Janeiro.<anchor n="95"
                        xml:id="d131-f2"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d131-f1" n="94" xml:id="d131-f1-content">
                <p>Same as telegram 1605, <ref target="#pg118">p. 118</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d131-f2" n="95" xml:id="d131-f2-content">
                <p>Repeated on the same date to Lisbon as No. 1536 and to Rio de Janeiro as No.
                    1654.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
